  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:38">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:38"/>
  </para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39"/>Yeinom ne asɔfoɔ a wɔfiri asutwa mu baeɛ:</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Yedaia (Yesua fie mufoɔ) asefoɔ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">973</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:39"/>
        <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40"/>Imer asefoɔ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">1,052</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:40"/>
        <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41"/>Pashur asefoɔ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">1,247</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:41"/>
        <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42"/>Harim asefoɔ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">1,017</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:42">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:42"/>
  </para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43"/>Yeinom ne Lewifoɔ a wɔfiri asutwa mu baeɛ:</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Yesua (Kadmiel ne Hodewa fiefoɔ) asefoɔ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">74</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:43">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:43"/>
  </para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44"/>Nnwontofoɔ:</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Asaf asefoɔ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">148</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:44">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:44"/>
  </para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45"/>Asɔredan Aponoanohwɛfoɔ:</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Salum, Ater, Talmon asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Akub, Hatita ne Sobai asefoɔ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">138</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:45">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:45"/>
  </para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46"/>Asɔredan mu asomfoɔ:</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Siha, Hasufa, Tabaot asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:46"/>
        <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47"/>Keros, Siaha, Padon asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:47"/>
        <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48"/>Lebana, Hagaba, Salmai asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:48"/>
        <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49"/>Hanan, Gidel, Gahar asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:49"/>
        <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50"/>Reaia, Resin, Nekoda asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:50"/>
        <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51"/>Gasam, Usa, Paseah asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:51"/>
        <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52"/>Besai, Meunim, Nefusim asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:52"/>
        <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53"/>Bakbuk, Hakufa, Harhur asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:53"/>
        <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54"/>Baslut, Mehida, Harsa asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:54"/>
        <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55"/>Barkos, Sisera, Tema asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:55"/>
        <verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56"/>Nesia ne Hatifa asefoɔ</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="li4" vid="NEH 7:56">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:56"/>
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57"/>Ɔhene Salomo asefoɔ asomfoɔ a wɔfiri asutwa mu baeɛ no nie:</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Sotai, Soferet, Perida asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:57"/>
        <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58"/>Yaala, Darkon, Gidel asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:58"/>
        <verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59"/>Sefatia, Hatil,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Pokeret-Hasebaim ne Ami asefoɔ,</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse eid="NEH 7:59"/>
        <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60"/>Asɔredan mu asomfoɔ ne Salomo asomfoɔ asefoɔ no nyinaa na wɔn dodoɔ yɛ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">392</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:60">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:60"/>
  </para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61"/>Ekuo foforɔ bi a saa ɛberɛ yi wɔfiri Tel-Melah, Tel-Harsa, Kerub, Adon ne Imer sane baa Yerusalem, nanso, wɔantumi ankyerɛ mu yie sɛ, wɔn anaa wɔn abusuafoɔ no ase firi Israel:<verse eid="NEH 7:61"/></para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62"/>Delaia, Tobia ne Nekoda asefoɔ no ka saa kuo yi ho, na wɔn dodoɔ yɛ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">642</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:62">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:62"/>
  </para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63"/>Asɔfoɔ baasa a wɔn din de</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:63">Habaia, Hakos ne Barsilai asefoɔ nso baa Yerusalem. (Na saa Barsilai yi aware Barsilai a ɔfiri Gilead mmammaa no baako ama wafa ɔbaa no abusua din.)<verse eid="NEH 7:63"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64"/>Nanso, na wɔayera wɔn abusuadua nwoma no enti wɔamma wɔn ho ɛkwan amma wɔansom sɛ asɔfoɔ. <verse eid="NEH 7:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65"/>Na amrado no mma ɛkwan mma wɔnnni afɔrebɔ nnuane mu kyɛfa mpo, gye sɛ ɔsɔfoɔ bi de ntonto kronkron bɔ a wɔfrɛ no Urim ne Tumim akyerɛ wɔn gyinabea wɔ saa asɛm yi ho.<verse eid="NEH 7:65"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66"/>Enti nnipa a wɔsane baa Yuda no nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ (42,360), <verse eid="NEH 7:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67"/>a ɛno akyi, asomfoɔ (7,337) a wɔyɛ mmaa ne mmarima a ɛmu (245) yɛ nnwomtofoɔ. <verse eid="NEH 7:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68"/>Wɔde apɔnkɔ ahanson ne aduasa nsia (736) mfunumpɔnkɔ ahanu ne aduanan enum (245). <verse eid="NEH 7:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69"/>Nyoma ahanan ne aduasa enum (435) ne mfunumu mpem nsia ahanson ne aduonu (6,720).<verse eid="NEH 7:69"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70"/>Abusua no bi ntuanofoɔ maa dwumadie no ho akyɛdeɛ. Amrado no too sikakorabea no mu sikakɔkɔɔ pranpran apem (1,000), sikakɔkɔɔ atam aduonum (50) ne asɔfotadeɛ ahanum ne aduasa (530). <verse eid="NEH 7:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71"/>Ntuanofoɔ no bi ka bɔɔ mu, too sikakorabea no mu sikakɔkɔɔ pranpran ɔpeduonu (20,000), na ebinom nso maa dwetɛ nsania kilogram mpem mmienu ahanu ne aduonu (2,220) de boaa adwuma no. <verse eid="NEH 7:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72"/>Nnipa a wɔaka no nso maa sikakɔkɔɔ pranpran ɔpeduonu ne dwetɛ bɛyɛ kilogram mpem ne ahanu ne asɔfotadeɛ aduosia nson (67).<verse eid="NEH 7:72"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73"/>Enti, asɔfoɔ, Lewifoɔ, aponoanohwɛfoɔ, nnwomtofoɔ, Asɔredan mu asomfoɔ ne nnipa no bi, ne Israelfoɔ a wɔaka nyinaa bɔɔ atenaseɛ wɔ wɔn ankasa nkuro so.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="NEH 7:73">Ɛsra Kenkan Mmara No</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:73">Ɔbosome Tisri (bɛyɛ Ɛbɔ ne Ahinime ntam) mfimfini mu a Israelfoɔ akokɔ wɔn nkuro so no,<verse eid="NEH 7:73"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1"/>ɔmanfoɔ no nyinaa hyiaa wɔ wɔn nsuseneeɛ ɛpono no ano. Ɔmanfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ Ɛsra a ɔyɛ mmara no kyerɛkyerɛni sɛ ɔnkenkan Mose mmara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ sɛ Israelfoɔ nni so no. <verse eid="NEH 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2"/>Enti, bosome Tisri (bɛyɛ Ahinime) da a ɛtɔ so nwɔtwe no, ɔsɔfoɔ Ɛsra de krataa mmobɔeɛ a mmara no wɔ mu no baa badwa no a mmarima ne mmaa ne mmɔfra a wɔanyini te asɛm ase no anim. <verse eid="NEH 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3"/>Ɔde nʼani kyerɛɛ adwaberem wɔ nsuseneeɛ ɛpono no ano, firi anɔpahema kɔsii owigyinaeɛ kenkanee mmara no den, maa obiara a ɔte aseɛ no teeɛ. Ɔmanfoɔ no nyinaa wɛnee wɔn aso, tiee mmara no.<verse eid="NEH 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4"/>Ɛsra a ɔyɛ mmara no kyerɛkyerɛni no gyinaa apa tenten bi a wɔsi maa saa da no so. Nnipa a na wɔgyinagyina ne nifa so no no din de Matitia, Sema, Anaia, Uria, Hilkia ne Maaseia. Wɔn a na wɔgyinagyina ne benkum so no no din de Pedaia, Misael, Malkia, Hasum, Hasbadana, Sakaria ne Mesulam.<verse eid="NEH 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5"/>Ɛsra gyinaa apa no so a nnipa dɔm no nyinaa hunu no. Ɛberɛ a wɔhunuu sɛ wabue nwoma no mu no, wɔn nyinaa sɔresɔre gyinaa wɔn nan so. <verse eid="NEH 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6"/>Na Ɛsra kamfoo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Otumfoɔ Onyankopɔn, na ɔmanfoɔ no bɔ gyee so sɛ, “Amen! Amen!” wɔ ɛberɛ a wɔmemaa wɔn nsa so kyerɛɛ ɔsoro. Afei, wɔkotokotoeɛ, somm <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a wɔn anim butubutu fam.<verse eid="NEH 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7"/>Afei, Lewifoɔ a wɔn din de Yesua, Bani, Serebia, Yamin, Akub, Sabetai, Hodia, Maaseia, Kelita, Asaria, Yosabad, Hanan ne Pelaia kyerɛɛ ɔmanfoɔ a wɔgyinagyina hɔ no deɛ wɔnyɛ. <verse eid="NEH 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8"/>Wɔkenkan firii Onyankopɔn mmara nwoma no mu kyerɛɛ wɔn deɛ wɔkenkan no ase, boaa ɔmanfoɔ no ma wɔtee twerɛpɛn biara ase.<verse eid="NEH 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9"/>Na amrado Nehemia, ɔsɔfoɔ Ɛsra a ɔyɛ mmara no kyerɛkyerɛni ne Lewifoɔ a na wɔrekyerɛkyerɛ aseɛ akyerɛ ɔmanfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monnsu ɛda a ɛte sɛ yei! Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnnɛ yɛ ɛda kronkron wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim.” Nnipa no tee mmara no mu nsɛm no, wɔn nyinaa suiɛ.<verse eid="NEH 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10"/>Na Nehemia toaa so sɛ, “Momfa nnuane pa ne anonneɛ a ɛyɛ dɛ nkɔdi afahyɛ no na mo ne wɔn a wɔnni nnuane pa a wɔanoa no nnidi. Ɛnnɛ yɛ da kronkron wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. Monnni abooboo ne awerɛhoɔ, na Awurade mu anigyeɛ no yɛ ahoɔden.”<verse eid="NEH 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11"/>Na Lewifoɔ no nso kasaa sɛ, “Hwɛ! Monnsu. Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnnɛ yɛ ɛda kronkron” de dwodwoo wɔn.<verse eid="NEH 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12"/>Na nnipa no kɔdidiiɛ, kyɛɛ nnuane, nomeeɛ, dii dapɔnna no anigyeɛ so, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔtee Onyankopɔn nsɛm, tee aseɛ.<verse eid="NEH 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13"/>Na bosome Tisri (bɛyɛ Ahinime) a ɛtɔ so nkron no, mmusua ntuanofoɔ no ne asɔfoɔ no ne Lewifoɔ no ne Ɛsra hyiaeɛ sɛ, wɔrekɔ mmara no mu fekɔfekɔ. <verse eid="NEH 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14"/>Wɔkɔɔ mmara no mu no, wɔhunuu sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam Mose so ahyɛ sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ Israelfoɔ no tena asese mu afahyɛ a wɔrebɛdi no saa bosome no mu no. <verse eid="NEH 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15"/>Waka sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔbɔ nhyɛ no ho dawuro wɔ wɔn nkuro nyinaa so, ne titire no, Yerusalem nam so aka akyerɛ ɔmanfoɔ no sɛ, wɔnkɔ nkokoɔ so nkɔpɛ ngo dua mman, kranku mman, ohwannua mman, ɛberɛ ne nnua kusukusuu mman, na wɔmfa mmɛbobɔ asese ntena mu, sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ no mmara no mu no.<verse eid="NEH 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16"/>Enti, nnipa no kɔtwitwaa mman, na wɔde sisii asese wɔ wɔn afie, wɔn adihɔ, Onyankopɔn asɔredan adihɔ anaa adwaberem a ɛwowɔ asutene apono no ne Efraim apono no mu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17"/>Enti, obiara a wafiri nneduasom mu aba no kɔtenaa saa asese yi mu afahyɛberɛ no nnanson mu, na obiara ani gyee yie. Ɛfiri Nun babarima Yosua berɛ so no, Israelfoɔ anni afahyɛ no saa ɛkwan yi so.<verse eid="NEH 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18"/>Ɛsra kenkan firii Onyankopɔn mmara nwoma no mu wɔ afahyɛ no mu nnanson no mu da biara. Afei, Tisri bosome (bɛyɛ Ahinime) da a ɛtɔ so dunum no, wɔyɛɛ nhyiamu anibereɛ so, sɛdeɛ Mose mmara hwehwɛ no.<verse eid="NEH 8:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ka Wɔn Bɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1"/>Bosome Tisri (bɛyɛ Ahinime) ɛda a ɛtɔ so aduasa baako no, ɔmanfoɔ no boaa wɔn ho ano, dii mmuada, firaa ayitoma, tuu mfuturo petee wɔn tirim. <verse eid="NEH 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔreka wɔn ankasa bɔne ne wɔn agyanom bɔne no, Israelfoɔ no twee wɔn ho firii ananafoɔ nyinaa ho. <verse eid="NEH 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3"/>Wɔkenkan <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Onyankopɔn, mmara nwoma no den bɛyɛ sɛ nnɔnhwere mmiɛnsa kyerɛɛ wɔn. Afei, wɔde nnɔnhwere mmiɛnsa bio kekaa wɔn bɔne nnidisoɔ nnidisoɔ wɔ ɛberɛ a na wɔresom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="NEH 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4"/>Na Lewifoɔ no bi gyina ntrapoe so reteam frɛ Awurade, wɔn Onyankopɔn. Saa nnipa no ne Yesua, Bani, Kadmiel, Sebania, Buni, Serebia, Bani ne Kenani. <verse eid="NEH 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5"/>Afei, Lewifoɔ ntuanofoɔ a wɔne Yesua, Kadmiel, Bani, Hasabnia, Serebia, Hodia, Sebania ne Petahia teaam frɛɛ ɔmanfoɔ no sɛ, “Monsɔre nkamfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔte hɔ afebɔɔ!”</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 9:5">Wɔtoaa so sɛ, “Monkamfo ne din kronkron no. Ɛso sene sɛdeɛ yɛbɛtumi adwene anaa deɛ yɛbɛka. <verse eid="NEH 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6"/>Wo nko ara ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Wo na wobɔɔ ɔsoro ne ɔsoro mu ɔsoro ne nsoromma nyinaa. Wo na wobɔɔ asase ne deɛ ɛwɔ so nyinaa ne ɛpo ne deɛ ɛwɔ mu nyinaa. Wo na wokora biribiara so ma no nkwa, na ɔsoro abɔfoɔ nyinaa som wo.<verse eid="NEH 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7"/>“Woyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Onyankopɔn a woyii Abram firii Ur a ɛwɔ Kaldea asase so, sane too no edin Abraham. <verse eid="NEH 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8"/>Ɔdii wo nokorɛ no, wo ne no yɛɛ apam sɛ, wode Kanaanfoɔ, Hetifoɔ, Perisifoɔ Yebusifoɔ ne Girgasifoɔ asase bɛma ɔne nʼasefoɔ. Na wodii wo bɔhyɛ so, ɛfiri sɛ, daa wodi wʼasɛm so.<verse eid="NEH 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9"/>“Wohunuu amane ne awerɛhoɔ a yɛn agyanom kɔɔ mu wɔ Misraim, na wotee wɔn su firi Ɛpo Kɔkɔɔ no ho. <verse eid="NEH 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10"/>Woyɛɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛyɛ hu ne anwanwadeɛ kyerɛɛ Farao, nʼasomfoɔ ne ne manfoɔ nyinaa, ɛfiri sɛ, na wonim nhyɛsoɔ ɛkwan a na Misraimfoɔ no de wɔn fa so. Wowɔ animuonyam a ahyeta a ani mpa so da. <verse eid="NEH 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11"/>Wopaee ɛpo mu maa wo nkurɔfoɔ, sɛdeɛ wɔbɛtumi afa asase wesee so. Na wopuaa wɔn atamfoɔ guu ɛpo bunu mu. Wɔmemem sɛ aboɔ wɔ nsubunu a emu dɔ no ase. <verse eid="NEH 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12"/>Wonam omununkum fadum so dii yɛn agyanom anim awia ne ogya fadum so, dii wɔn anim anadwo sɛdeɛ wɔbɛhunu ɛkwan.<verse eid="NEH 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13"/>“Wosianee bepɔ Sinai, kasa kyerɛɛ wɔn firi ɔsoro. Wode mmara a ɛyɛ turodoo ne ahyɛdeɛ a ɛyɛ nokorɛ brɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="NEH 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14"/>Wokyerɛɛ wɔn mmara a ɛfa wo homeda kronkron ho. Na wonam wo ɔsomfoɔ Mose so hyɛɛ wɔn sɛdeɛ wɔnsi nni wʼahyɛdeɛ ne wo mmara no nyinaa so. <verse eid="NEH 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15"/>Ɛberɛ a ɛkɔm de wɔn no, womaa wɔn burodo a ɛfiri ɔsoro ne nsuo a ɛfiri ɔbotan mu wɔ ɛberɛ a sukɔm de wɔn no. Wohyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnkɔfa asase a woaka ho ntam sɛ wode bɛma wɔn no.<verse eid="NEH 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16"/>“Nanso, yɛn agyanom yɛɛ ahantan ne asoɔden, na wɔanni wʼahyɛdeɛ so. <verse eid="NEH 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17"/>Wɔantie, na wɔankae wʼanwanwadeɛ a woyɛ maa wɔn no. Mmom, wɔyɛɛ dɔm yii ntuanoni sɛ ɔnsane mfa wɔn nkɔ wɔn nkoasom mu wɔ Misraim. Nanso, woyɛ ɔfakyɛfoɔ, ahummɔborɔ ne ɔdomfoɔ Onyankopɔn a wo bo kyɛre fu na wʼadɔeɛ dɔɔso. Woannyaa wɔn <verse eid="NEH 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18"/>wɔ ɛberɛ a wɔyɛɛ ohoni sɛso a ɔte sɛ nantwie ba na wɔkaa sɛ, ‘Yei ne mo nyame a ɔyii mo firii Misraim no.’ Wɔyɛɛ bɔne, kekaa abususɛm a ɛyɛ hu.<verse eid="NEH 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19"/>“Nanso, wo mmɔborɔhunu mu, woannyaa wɔn amma wɔanwuwu wɔ ɛserɛ no so. Omununkum fadum no kɔɔ so dii wɔn anim awia, na ogya fadum no kyerɛɛ wɔn ɛkwan anadwo. <verse eid="NEH 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20"/>Wosomaa wo honhom pa no kyerɛɛ wɔn deɛ wɔnyɛ, na woannyae sɛ wobɛma wɔn burodo afiri soro anaa nsuo wɔ ɛberɛ a sukɔm de wɔn. <verse eid="NEH 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21"/>Wohwɛɛ wɔn so mfeɛ aduanan wɔ ɛserɛ so. Saa ɛberɛ no, biribiara anhia wɔn. Wɔn ntadeɛ antete, na wɔn anan ase antaatae.<verse eid="NEH 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22"/>“Woboaa yɛn agyanom, ma wɔdii ahemman akɛseɛ ne aman bebree so, na wode wo nkurɔfoɔ duaa aman no afanan nyinaa so. Wɔfaa ɔhene Sihon a ɔfiri Hesbon ne Basanhene Og asase no nyinaa. <verse eid="NEH 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23"/>Womaa wɔn asefoɔ dɔɔso sɛ ɔsoro nsoromma, na wode wɔn baa asase a woahyɛ wɔn agyanom ho bɔ no so. <verse eid="NEH 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24"/>Wɔkɔfaa asase no. Wobrɛɛ aman no nyinaa ase wɔ wɔn anim. Na, mpo, ahemfo ne Kanaanfoɔ a wɔtenaa asase no so no tumi saeɛ. Wo nkurɔfoɔ ne wɔn dii no sɛdeɛ wɔpɛ. <verse eid="NEH 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25"/>Yɛn agyanom faa nkuro a wɔabɔ ho ban ne nsase bereɛ no. Wɔfaa afie a nnepa wɔ mu ne nsuseneeɛ a wɔatutu dada no ne bobefuo ne ngofuo ne nnuabafuo no bebree. Enti, wɔdidiiɛ ara kɔsii sɛ wɔdodɔreeɛ, yɛɛ akɛseɛ, na wɔn ani gyee wɔn ho wɔ wo nhyira mu.<verse eid="NEH 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26"/>“Nanso, yeinom nyinaa akyi no, wɔyɛɛ asoɔden, yɛɛ dɔm tiaa wo. Wɔtoo wo mmara no guu nkyɛn. Wɔkunkumm adiyifoɔ no a wɔhyɛɛ wɔn nkuran sɛ wɔnsane mmra wo nkyɛn no, na wɔkaa abususɛm a ɛyɛ hu. <verse eid="NEH 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27"/>Enti, wode wɔn hyɛɛ wɔn atamfoɔ nsa. Nanso, wɔn amanehunu mu no, wɔsu frɛɛ wo, na wotiee wɔn firi ɔsoro. Na ahummɔborɔ a ɛso mu, wosomaa agyefoɔ a wɔgyee wɔn firii wɔn atamfoɔ nsam.<verse eid="NEH 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28"/>“Nanso, na nneɛma nyinaa rekɔ so yie no, wo manfoɔ sane kɔɔ bɔne mu bio, na wosane maa wɔn atamfoɔ dii wɔn so. Nanso, ɛberɛ biara a wo nkurɔfoɔ bɛsu afrɛ wo bio, apɛ mmoa no, wotiee bio firi ɔsoro. Wʼahummɔborɔ nwanwa enti, wogyee wɔn ntoatoasoɔ.<verse eid="NEH 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29"/>“Wobɔɔ wɔn kɔkɔ sɛ, wɔnsane mmɛdi wo mmara no so nanso, wɔyɛɛ ahomasoɔ ne asoɔden a wɔanni wʼahyɛdeɛ no so. Wɔanni wo mmara a sɛ nnipa di so a, wɔnam so bɛnya nkwa. Nanso, wɔnam ahomasoɔ so danee wɔn akyi kyerɛɛ wo a wɔampɛ sɛ wɔbɛtie wo. <verse eid="NEH 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30"/>Wo dɔ enti, wonyaa wɔn ho ntoboaseɛ mfeɛ bebree. Wosomaa wo honhom a ɔnam adiyifoɔ so bɔɔ wɔn kɔkɔ faa wɔn bɔne ho. Nanso, ɛkɔka he ara a, wɔntie. Enti, bio, womaa abosonsomfoɔ a wɔwɔ asase yi so no ho kwan, ma wɔdii wɔn so. <verse eid="NEH 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31"/>Nanso, wo mmɔborɔhunu a ɛdɔɔso enti, woantɔre wɔn ase anaa woannyaa wɔn afebɔɔ. Woyɛ ɔdomfoɔ ne ahummɔborɔ Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="NEH 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32"/>“Afei, yɛn Onyankopɔn, ɔkɛseɛ, otumfoɔ ne ɔnwanwani Onyankopɔn a ne dɔ apam a ɔyɛeɛ no ɔmmu so, mma yɛn amanehunu a yɛkɔɔ mu no nyinaa nnyɛ ɔkwa wɔ wʼanim. Ɔhaw kɛseɛ aba yɛn ne yɛn ahemfo, yɛn ahenemma ne asɔfoɔ ne adiyifoɔ ne yɛn agyanom so, firi ɛberɛ a Asiria ahemfo didii yɛn so nkonim, de bɛsi saa ɛberɛ yi. <verse eid="NEH 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33"/>Ɛberɛ biara a wobɛtwe yɛn aso no, na ɛfata. Yɛayɛ bɔne kɛseɛ a wotwe yɛn aso sɛdeɛ ɛsɛ wɔ so. <verse eid="NEH 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34"/>Yɛn ahemfo, ahenemma, asɔfoɔ, ne yɛn agyanom no anni wo mmara so anaa wʼahyɛdeɛ ne wo kɔkɔbɔ denden no so. <verse eid="NEH 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35"/>Mpo, ɛberɛ a wɔn ankasa nyaa wɔn ahemman no, wɔansom wo wɔ ɛberɛ a woahwie wʼayamyɛ adom agu wɔn so no. Womaa wɔn nsase pa akɛseɛ nanso, wɔannu wɔn ho amfiri wɔn amumuyɛsɛm ho.<verse eid="NEH 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36"/>“Enti, seesei, yɛyɛ nkoa wɔ asase a nnepa abu so wɔ so a wode maa yɛn agyanom no so. Dodoɔ yi nyinaa mu, yɛyɛ nkoa. <verse eid="NEH 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37"/>Afudeɛ a ɛbu so boro so no nyinaa akɔdi ahemfo a ɛsiane yɛn bɔne enti, woatu wɔn sɛ wɔnhwɛ yɛn so no nsam. Wɔwɔ yɛn ne yɛn anantwie so tumi. Yɛsom wɔn sɛdeɛ wɔpɛ, na yɛwɔ ahokyere kɛseɛ mu.<verse eid="NEH 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔti Apam No Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38"/>“Yeinom nyinaa akyi, yɛnam nkurukyire so rehyɛ bɔ a emu yɛ den. Saa nsɔano krataa yi mu na yɛn ahenemma ne Lewifoɔ ne asɔfoɔ din wɔ.”<verse eid="NEH 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1"/>Nwoma a wɔgye too mu na wɔsɔɔ ano, saa edin yi na na ɛwɔ mu:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:1"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:1">Hakalia babarima Nehemia a na ɔyɛ amrado.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:1"/>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:1">Asɔfoɔ a wɔde wɔn nsa hyɛɛ aseɛ no ne Sedekia, <verse eid="NEH 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2"/>Seraia, Asaria, Yeremia,<verse eid="NEH 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3"/>Pashur, Amaria, Malkia,<verse eid="NEH 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4"/>Hatus, Sebania, Maluk,<verse eid="NEH 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5"/>Harim, Meremot, Obadia,<verse eid="NEH 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6"/>Daniel, Gineton, Baruk,<verse eid="NEH 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7"/>Mesulam, Abia, Miyamin,<verse eid="NEH 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8"/>Maasia, Bilgai ne Semaia.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:8">Yeinom ne asɔfoɔ no.<verse eid="NEH 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9"/>Lewifoɔ a wɔde wɔn nsa hyɛɛ aseɛ no ne:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:9">Asania babarima Yesua, Binui a ɔfiri Henadad abusua mu, Kadmiel,<verse eid="NEH 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10"/>ne wɔn mfɛfoɔ Lewifoɔ a, wɔne:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:10">Sebania, Hodia, Kelita, Pelaia, Hanan,<verse eid="NEH 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11"/>Mika, Rehob, Hasabia,<verse eid="NEH 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12"/>Sakur, Serebia, Sebania,<verse eid="NEH 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13"/>Hodia, Bani ne Beninu.<verse eid="NEH 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14"/>Ntuanofoɔ a wɔde wɔn nsa hyɛɛ aseɛ no ne:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:14">Paros, Pahat-Moab, Elam, Satu, Bani,<verse eid="NEH 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15"/>Buni, Asgad, Bebai,<verse eid="NEH 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16"/>Adoniya, Bigwai, Adin,<verse eid="NEH 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17"/>Ater, Hesekia, Asur,<verse eid="NEH 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18"/>Hodia, Hasum, Besai,<verse eid="NEH 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19"/>Harif, Anatot, Nebai,<verse eid="NEH 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20"/>Magpias, Mesulam, Hesir,<verse eid="NEH 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21"/>Mesesabel, Sadok, Yadua,<verse eid="NEH 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22"/>Pelatia, Hanan, Anaia,<verse eid="NEH 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23"/>Hosea, Hanania, Hasub,<verse eid="NEH 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24"/>Halohes, Pilha, Sobek,<verse eid="NEH 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25"/>Rehum, Hasabna, Maaseia,<verse eid="NEH 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26"/>Ahiya, Hanan, Anan,<verse eid="NEH 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27"/>Maluk, Harim, Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28"/>“Nnipa no nkaeɛ a wɔyɛ asɔfoɔ, Lewifoɔ, aponoanohwɛfoɔ, nnwomtofoɔ, Asɔredan mu asomfoɔ ne wɔn a wɔatwe wɔn ho afiri abosonsomfoɔ a wɔwɔ asase no so nyinaa, sɛdeɛ wɔbɛsom Onyankopɔn, na wɔanyinyini a wɔte asɛm ase no, <verse eid="NEH 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29"/>wɔn nyinaa firi akoma pa mu kaa ntam, de kyekyeree wɔn ho. Wɔkaa ntam dii nse sɛ, sɛ wɔbu Onyankopɔn mmara a ɔnam ne ɔsomfoɔ Mose so de abrɛ wɔn no so a, nnome biara a Onyankopɔn de bɛba wɔn so no, wɔpene so. Wɔfiri akoma mu hyɛɛ bɔ sɛ, wɔbɛto wɔn bo adi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Wura, ahyɛdeɛ ne ne mmara nyinaa so.<verse eid="NEH 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnipa No Bɔhyɛ</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30"/>“Yɛhyɛ bɔ sɛ, yɛremma yɛn mmammaa nware abosonsomfoɔ a wɔwɔ asase no so, na saa ara nso na yɛremma yɛn mmammarima nso nware wɔn mmammaa.<verse eid="NEH 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31"/>“Yɛsane hyɛ bɔ sɛ, sɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ asase no so de adwadeɛ anaa atokoɔ ba bɛtɔn no homeda anaa ɛda kronkron bi a, yɛrentɔ bi. Na yɛhyɛ bɔ sɛ, yɛrenyɛ adwuma biara mfeɛ nson a ɛbɛba biara mu, na ɛka biara a Yudafoɔ afoforɔ bi de yɛn no, yɛbɛtwam.<verse eid="NEH 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32"/>“Deɛ ɛka ho ne sɛ, yɛhyɛ bɔ sɛ, yɛbɛtua Asɔredan afirinhyia toɔ a wɔahyɛ yɛn sɛ yɛntua a ɛyɛ dwetɛ gram ɛnan, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛma wɔanya sika bebree de abɔ yɛn Onyankopɔn Asɔredan no ho bra. <verse eid="NEH 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33"/>Yei bɛboa ama yɛanya Hyiadan mu Burodo no, na yɛatumi abɔ atokoɔ ne ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ berɛ ano berɛ ano, abɔ homeda afɔdeɛ hodoɔ, adi ɔbosome foforɔ afahyɛ ahodoɔ ne dapɔnna ahodoɔ no. Saa ara na ɛbɛma yɛatumi abɔ kronkronyɛ afɔdeɛ ne bɔne ho afɔdeɛ sɛ mpatadeɛ ama Israel. Afei, ɛbɛboa ama yɛanya nneɛma bi a ɛho bɛhia ama yɛn Onyankopɔn Asɔredan no ho adwumayɛ.<verse eid="NEH 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34"/>“Yɛabɔ ntonto hodoɔ, ahunu afe biara mu mmerɛ a ɛfata sɛ asɔfoɔ, Lewifoɔ ne ɔmanfoɔ no abusuafoɔ de nnyensin ba Onyankopɔn asɔredan ho na wɔhye no <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn afɔrebukyia so, sɛdeɛ mmara no kyerɛ no.<verse eid="NEH 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35"/>“Yɛhyɛ bɔ sɛ, daa yɛde otwakane biara mu kyɛfa bi, sɛ ɛyɛ asaseduane anaa aduaba a ɛfiri nnua so bɛba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Asɔredan mu.<verse eid="NEH 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36"/>“Yɛpene so sɛ, yɛde yɛn mmammarima a wɔyɛ abakan ne yɛn anantwie ne yɛn nnwan mmakan bɛma Onyankopɔn, sɛdeɛ mmara no kyerɛ no. Yɛde wɔn bɛma asɔfoɔ a wɔsom wɔ yɛn Onyankopɔn Asɔredan mu no.<verse eid="NEH 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37"/>“Yɛbɛkora mfudeɛ no nyinaa wɔ yɛn Onyankopɔn Asɔredan adekoradan mu. Yɛde yɛn asikyiresiam a ɛyɛ pa ara ne atokoɔ nkaeɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ, yɛn nnuaba papa ne yɛn nsã foforɔ papa ne ngo bɛba. Na yɛhyɛ bɔ sɛ, yɛde yɛn mfudeɛ biara a ɛfiri yɛn asase so nkyɛmu edu mu baako bɛbrɛ Lewifoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn na wɔgyegye ntotosoɔ dudu no wɔ yɛn nkuraase. <verse eid="NEH 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38"/>Ɔsɔfoɔ a ɔyɛ Aaron aseni bɛka Lewifoɔ no ho wɔ ɛberɛ a wɔregyegye ntotosoɔ dudu no. Na biribiara a wɔbɛgye sɛ ntotosoɔ dudu no, Lewifoɔ de mu nkyɛmu edu mu baako bɛkɔ yɛn Onyankopɔn Asɔredan no mu, na wɔde akɔsisi adekoradan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na adekoradan bebree wɔ asɔredan no mfinimfini a ɛhɔ na na wɔkora nneɛma a ɛyɛ kronkron.</char></note> no mu. <verse eid="NEH 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔmanfoɔ no ne Lewifoɔ no de afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ atokoɔ, nsã foforɔ ne ngo no bɛgu adekoradeɛ kronkron a ɛbɛn asɔfoɔ a wɔresom no, aponoanohwɛfoɔ ne nnwomtofoɔ no wɔ Asɔredan no mu.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 10:39">“Enti, yɛbɔ mu hyɛ bɔ sɛ yɛrentoto yɛn Onyankopɔn Asɔredan no ase.”<verse eid="NEH 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Nnipa No Kɔtena Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1"/>Afei, saa ɛberɛ yi, na ɔmanfoɔ no ntuanofoɔ tete Yerusalem, kuropɔn kronkron no mu. Wɔbɔɔ ntonto kronkron wɔ nnipa no a na wɔtete Yuda ne Benyamin nkuro bi no so, yii mu nkyɛmu edu mu baako, ma wɔn nso kɔtenaa hɔ. Na nkaeɛ no deɛ, wɔtenaa deɛ wɔte hɔ ara. <verse eid="NEH 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2"/>Na ɔmanfoɔ no kamfoo obiara a ɔfiri ne pɛ mu sane kɔtenaa Yerusalem no.<verse eid="NEH 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3"/>Amantam mu mpanimfoɔ a wɔbaa Yerusalem no din na wɔatwerɛ wɔ ha yi. Ɔmanfoɔ no mu fa kɛseɛ a wɔyɛ asɔfoɔ, Lewifoɔ, Asɔredan mu asomfoɔ ne Salomo asomfoɔ asefoɔ no kɔɔ so tenaa wɔn ankasa afie mu wɔ Yuda nkuro ahodoɔ so, <verse eid="NEH 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4"/>nanso, nnipa no bi a wɔfiri Yuda ne Benyamin mu no sane kɔtenaa Yerusalem.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:4"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 11:4">Yuda abusuakuo mu nnipa no nie:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:4">Usia babarima Ataia, Sakaria babarima, Amaria babarima, Sefatia babarima, Mahalalel babarima a ɔfiri Peres abusua mu;<verse eid="NEH 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5"/>Baruk babarima Maaseia, Kol-Hose babarima, Hasaia babarima, Adaia babarima, Yoiarib babarima, Sakaria babarima a ɔfiri Sela abusua mu.<verse eid="NEH 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6"/>Afei, na Peres asefoɔ ahanan ne aduosia nwɔtwe (468) a wɔdi mu no na na wɔte Yerusalem.<verse eid="NEH 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7"/>Benyamin abusuakuo no mu nnipa nie:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:7">Mesulam babarima Salu, Yoed babarima, Pedaia babarima, Kolaia babarima, Maaseia babarima, Itiel babarima ne Yesaia babarima; <verse eid="NEH 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8"/>na nʼakyiri no na Gabai ne Salai, ne abusuafoɔ ahankron aduonu nwɔtwe (928) ba.<verse eid="NEH 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9"/>Wɔn panin pa ara no ne Sikri babarima Yoɛl na Hasenua, a ɔyɛ kuropɔn no sohwɛfoɔ abadiakyire babarima Yuda boaa no.<verse eid="NEH 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10"/>Asɔfoɔ no mu nnipa nie:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:10">Yoiarib babarima Yedaia; Yakin;<verse eid="NEH 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11"/>ne Hilkia babarima Seraia, Mesulam babarima, Sadok babarima, Meraiot babarima ne Ahitub a na ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn Asɔredan no sohwɛfoɔ babarima, <verse eid="NEH 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12"/>ne wɔn mfɛfoɔ aha nwɔtwe aduonu mmienu (822) a, na wɔyɛ adwuma wɔ Asɔredan no mu, ne Yeroham babarima Adaia, Pelalia babarima, Amsi babarima, Sakaria babarima, Pashur babarima, Malkia babarima <verse eid="NEH 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13"/>ne ne mfɛfoɔ ahanu aduanan mmienu (242) a wɔyɛ wɔn mmusua ntuanofoɔ. Wɔn a na wɔka ho nso ne Asarel babarima Amasai, Ahsai babarima, Mesilemot babarima, Imer babarima <verse eid="NEH 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14"/>ne ne mfɛfoɔ atitire ɔha aduonu nwɔtwe (128). Wɔn panin pa ara a ɔtua wɔn ano no ne Hagedolim babarima Sabdiel.<verse eid="NEH 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15"/>Lewifoɔ no nso nie:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:15">Hasub babarima Semaia, Asrikam babarima, Hasabia babarima, Buni babarima;<verse eid="NEH 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16"/>ne Sabetai ne Yosabad a na wɔhwɛ Onyankopɔn Asɔredan no mfikyire dwumadie so;<verse eid="NEH 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17"/>Mika babarima Matania, Sabdi babarima a ɔyɛ Asaf aseni a ɔde mpaeɛbɔ buee aseda afɔdeɛ som ano;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:17">Bakbukia a na ɔyɛ Matania abadiakyire ne Samua babarima Abda, Galal babarima, Yedutun babarima.<verse eid="NEH 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18"/>Ne nyinaa mu, na Lewifoɔ ahanu aduɔwɔtwe ɛnan (284) na na wɔwɔ kuropɔn kronkron no mu.<verse eid="NEH 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19"/>Aponoanohwɛfoɔ no nie:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:19">Akub, Talmon ne wɔn mfɛfoɔ ɔha aduɔson mmienu (172) a na wɔwɛn wɔ apono no ano.<verse eid="NEH 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20"/>Asɔfoɔ a aka no, Lewifoɔ ne Israelfoɔ nkaeɛ no tenatenaa Yudaman mu baabiara a wɔn agyapadeɛ wɔ.<verse eid="NEH 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21"/>Nanso, Asɔredan mu asomfoɔ no a na wɔn ntuanofoɔ yɛ Siha ne Gispa no deɛ, wɔn nyinaa kɔtenaa Ofel kokoɔ so.<verse eid="NEH 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22"/>Na ɔpanin pa ara a ɔtua Lewifoɔ a wɔwɔ Yerusalem ano no ne Bani babarima Usi, Hasabia babarima, Matania babarima, Mika babarima a ɔyɛ Asaf aseni, a na nʼabusuafoɔ somm sɛ nnwomtofoɔ wɔ Onyankopɔn asɔredan mu no. <verse eid="NEH 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23"/>Na wɔhyɛ ɔhene mmara a ɛkyerɛ deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyɛ da biara no ase.<verse eid="NEH 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24"/>Mesesabel babarima Petahia a ɔyɛ Yuda babarima Serah aseni no yɛ ɔhene ananmusini wɔ ɔman no amammuo mu.<verse eid="NEH 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25"/>Yudafoɔ no bi tenaa Kiriat-Arba ne ne nkuraaseɛ, Dibon ne ne nkuraaseɛ ne Yekabseel ne ne nkuraaseɛ. <verse eid="NEH 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26"/>Wɔtenatenaa Yesua, Molada, Bet-Pelet, <verse eid="NEH 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27"/>Hasar-Sual, Beer-Seba ne ɛho nkuraa so, <verse eid="NEH 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28"/>Siklag ne Mekona ne ɛho nkuraa so. <verse eid="NEH 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29"/>Na wɔtete En-Rimon, Sora, Yarmut, <verse eid="NEH 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30"/>Sanoa ne Adulam ne wɔn nkuraa so nso. Na wɔtete Lakis ne ne mfuo a ɛbemmɛn hɔ no so ne Aseka ne ne nkuraa so nso. Enti, Yudafoɔ no tenatena nsase a ɛfiri Beer-Seba kɔsi Hinom bɔnhwa no mu.<verse eid="NEH 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31"/>Benyamin nkurɔfoɔ no bi tenaa Geba, Mikmas, Aya ne Bet-El ne ɛho nkuraa so. <verse eid="NEH 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32"/>Ebinom nso tenatenaa Anatot, Nob, Anania, <verse eid="NEH 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33"/>Hasor, Rama, Gitaim, <verse eid="NEH 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34"/>Hadid, Seboim, Nebalat, <verse eid="NEH 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35"/>Lod, Ono ne Adwumfoɔ Bɔnhwa mu nso.<verse eid="NEH 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36"/>Wɔmaa Lewifoɔ a na wɔtete Yuda no bi kɔkaa Benyamin abusuakuo no ho, ne wɔn tenaeɛ.<verse eid="NEH 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɔfoɔ Ne Lewifoɔ Ho Abakɔsɛm</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1"/>Saa nnipa yi ne asɔfoɔ ne Lewifoɔ a wɔne Sealtiel babarima Serubabel ne ɔsɔfopanin Yesua sanee wɔn akyi no:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:1"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:1">Seraia, Yeremia, Ɛsra,<verse eid="NEH 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2"/>Amaria, Maluk, Hatus,<verse eid="NEH 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3"/>Sekania, Rehum, Meremot,<verse eid="NEH 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4"/>Ido, Ginetoi, Abia,<verse eid="NEH 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5"/>Miamin, Maadia, Bilga,<verse eid="NEH 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6"/>Semaia, Yoiarib, Yedaia,<verse eid="NEH 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7"/>Salu, Amok, Hilkia ne Yedaia.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:7"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="NEH 12:7">Yesua ɛberɛ so no, na yeinom ne asɔfoɔ ntuanofoɔ ne wɔn mfɛfoɔ.<verse eid="NEH 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8"/>Lewifoɔ a wɔne wɔn sanee wɔn akyi no nie: Yesua, Binui Kadmiel, Serebia, Yuda, Matania a na ɔne ne mfɛfoɔ na na wɔhwɛ aseda nnwom so no. <verse eid="NEH 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9"/>Na sɛ wɔresom a, wɔn mfɛfoɔ Bakbukia ne Uni sɔre gyina ne wɔn di nhwɛanimu.<verse eid="NEH 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10"/>Ɔsɔfopanin Yesua woo Yoiakim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:10">Yoiakim woo Eliasib,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:10">Eliasib woo Yoiada,<verse eid="NEH 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11"/>na Yoiada woo Yonatan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:11">na Yonatan woo Yadua.<verse eid="NEH 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12"/>Ɛberɛ a Yoiakim yɛ ɔsɔfopanin no, na asɔfoɔ mmusua mu ntuanofoɔ no ne:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:12"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">Meraia a ɔtua Seraia abusua ano.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">Hanania a ɔtua Yeremia abusua ano.<verse eid="NEH 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13"/>Mesulam a ɔtua Ɛsra abusua ano.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:13">Yehohanan a ɔtua Amaria abusua ano.<verse eid="NEH 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14"/>Yonatan a ɔtua Maluki abusua ano.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:14">Yosef a ɔtua Sebania abusua ano.<verse eid="NEH 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15"/>Adna a ɔtua Harim abusua ano.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:15">Helkai a ɔtua Meraiot abusua ano.<verse eid="NEH 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16"/>Sakaria a ɔtua Ido abusua ano.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:16">Mesulam a ɔtua Gineton abusua ano.<verse eid="NEH 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17"/>Sikri a ɔtua Abia abusua ano.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:17">Miniamin ne Moadia abusua nso yɛ Piltai.<verse eid="NEH 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18"/>Samua a ɔtua Bilga abusua ano.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:18">Yehonatan a ɔtua Semaia abusua ano.<verse eid="NEH 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19"/>Matenai a ɔtua Yoiarib abusua ano.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:19">Usi a ɔtua Yedaia abusua ano.<verse eid="NEH 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20"/>Kalai a ɔtua Salai abusua ano.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:20">Eber a ɔtua Amok abusua ano.<verse eid="NEH 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21"/>Hasabia a ɔtua Hilkia abusua ano.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:21">Netanel a ɔtua Yedaia abusua ano.<verse eid="NEH 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22"/>Persiahene Dario a ɔtɔ so mmienu ɛberɛ so no, wɔtwerɛɛ Lewifoɔ ne asɔfoɔ mmusua mu ntuanofoɔ no nyinaa din wɔ saa asɔfoɔ mpanimfoɔ yi pɛn so: Eliasib, Yoiada, Yohanan, ne Yadua. <verse eid="NEH 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23"/>Wɔtwerɛɛ Lewifoɔ mmusua ntuanofoɔ no din guu Abakɔsɛm Nwoma mu kɔsii Eliasib nana Yohanan ɛberɛ so. <verse eid="NEH 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24"/>Yeinom ne Lewifoɔ mmusua ntuanofoɔ: Hasabia, Serebia, Yesua, Binui, Kadmiel ne wɔn mfɛfoɔ bi a, sɛ ɛduru ayɛyie ne aseda afahyɛ so a, wɔgyina hɔ ne wɔn di nhwɛanimu, na ɛfa gye ɛfa so wɔ nnwontoɔ mu, sɛdeɛ Dawid, Onyankopɔn onipa, kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ no.<verse eid="NEH 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25"/>Na Matania, Bakbukia ne Obadia nso ka ho. Mesulam, Talmon ne Akub na wɔyɛ aponoanohwɛfoɔ a wɔhwɛ adekoradan a ɛwɔ apono no ano no so. <verse eid="NEH 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26"/>Na yeinom nyinaa somm wɔ Yesua babarima Yoiakim a ɔyɛ Yosadak nana ne Nehemia a ɔyɛ amrado ne Ɛsra a na ɔyɛ ɔsɔfoɔ ne mmara no ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ berɛ so.<verse eid="NEH 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔdwira Yerusalem Ɔfasuo No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔredwira Yerusalem ɔfasuo foforɔ no ho no, wɔka kyerɛɛ Lewifoɔ a wɔwɔ asase no so nyinaa sɛ, wɔmmra Yerusalem mmɛboa dwumadie no. Na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde kyankyan, mmɛnta ne asankuten to wɔn aseda nnwom de hyɛ anigyeɛ fa no. <verse eid="NEH 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28"/>Wɔde nnwomtofoɔ no firi Yerusalem ne ne nkuraaseɛ ne Netofafoɔ nkuraaseɛ nyinaa bɔɔ mu baeɛ. <verse eid="NEH 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29"/>Ebi nso firi Bet-Gilgal ne Geba pɔ mu hɔ ne Asmawet, ɛfiri sɛ, na nnwomtofoɔ no ara akyekyere wɔn ankasa nkuraa afa Yerusalem ho ahyia. <verse eid="NEH 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30"/>Asɔfoɔ no ne Lewifoɔ no dwiraa wɔn ho, afei wɔdwiraa ɔmanfoɔ no ho, dwiraa apono no ne ɔfasuo no nso ho.<verse eid="NEH 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31"/>Medii Yuda ntuanofoɔ no anim kɔɔ ɔfasuo no atifi, na meboaboaa nnwomtofoɔ akuo akɛseɛ mmienu ano, ma wɔbɛdaa ase. Nnwontofoɔ ekuo no mu baako kɔɔ anafoɔ wɔ ɔfasuo no atifi kɔsii Sumina Ɛpono no. <verse eid="NEH 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32"/>Hosaia ne Yuda ntuanofoɔ no mu fa dii wɔn akyi, <verse eid="NEH 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33"/>na Asaria, Ɛsra, Mesulam, <verse eid="NEH 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34"/>Yuda, Benyamin, Semaia, Yeremia <verse eid="NEH 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35"/>ne asɔfoɔ no bi a wɔhyɛne totorobɛnto no dii wɔn akyi. Ɛno akyi na Yonatan babarima Sakaria, Semaia babarima, Matania babarima, Mikaia babarima, Sakur babarima a ɔyɛ Asaf aseni no di hɔ. <verse eid="NEH 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36"/>Ne korakora no, Sakaria mfɛfoɔ a wɔne Semaia, Asarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Netanel, Yuda ne Hanani dii wɔn so. Wɔfaa nnwontodeɛ a Dawid a ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn onipa akyerɛ sɛ wɔmfa no. Na Ɛsra a ɔyɛ mmara no ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no na ɔdii santen no anim. <verse eid="NEH 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37"/>Wɔfaa nsuo Aniwa Ɛpono no ho, kɔɔ tee kɔforoo kuropɔn no ɔfasuo atwedeɛ a ɛkyerɛ Dawid kuropɔn no. Wɔfaa Dawid efie ho, kɔsii Nsuo Ɛpono a ɛwɔ apueeɛ fam no ho.<verse eid="NEH 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38"/>Nnwontofoɔ a wɔtɔ so mmienu no faa atifi ɛkwan kɔhyiaa wɔn. Me ne ɔmanfoɔ no mu fa dii wɔn akyi. Yɛfaa ɔfasuo no so nam Fononoo Abantenten no ho kɔsii Ɔfasuo Tɛtrɛtɛ no, <verse eid="NEH 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39"/>afei yɛtwaa Efraim Ɛpono no ho, kɔsii Kuropɔn Dada Ɛpono no, yɛfaa Mpataa Ɛpono no ho, kɔsii Hananel Abantenten ho kɔɔ Ɔha Abantenten no ho. Yɛtoaa so kɔɔ Nnwan Ɛpono no ho, na yɛkɔgyinaa Ɔwɛn Ɛpono ano.<verse eid="NEH 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40"/>Nnwontokuo mmienu a na wɔreda ase no kɔɔ Awurade Asɔredan mu kɔtenatenaa ase. Me nso me ne akuo ntuanofoɔ a na wɔka me ho no yɛɛ saa ara. <verse eid="NEH 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41"/>Yɛne asɔfoɔ a na wɔhyɛn totorobɛnto a wɔne Eliakim, Maaseia, Miniamin, Mikaia, Elioenai, Sakaria, Hanania <verse eid="NEH 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42"/>ne nnwomtofoɔ Maaseia, Semaia, Eleasa, Usi, Yehohanan, Malkia, Elam ne Eser na yɛbɔɔ mu kɔeɛ. Wɔtoo nnwom denden so a na dwomkyerɛfoɔ Yisrahia rema wɔn akwankyerɛ. <verse eid="NEH 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43"/>Saa anigyeɛ da no, wɔbɔɔ afɔdeɛ bebree, ɛfiri sɛ, na Onyankopɔn ayɛ biribi ama wɔn a enti ɛsɛ sɛ wɔma wɔn ani gyeɛ. Mmaa ne mmɔfra nyinaa de wɔn ho hyɛɛ afahyɛ no mu, na ɔmanfoɔ a wɔwɔ Yerusalem no osebɔ no duruu akyirikyiri.<verse eid="NEH 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nneɛma A Ɛhia Wɔ Asɔredan Mu Ɔsom Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44"/>Ɛda no, wɔyii mmarima sɛ wɔnhwɛ adekoradan a wɔde akyɛdeɛ, otwakane ne ntotosoɔ dudu gu mu no so. Na ɛyɛ wɔn asɛdeɛ sɛ wɔkɔgyegye firi mfuo mu, sɛdeɛ asɔfoɔ ne Lewifoɔ mmara kyerɛ no, ɛfiri sɛ, na asɔfoɔ ne Lewifoɔ ne wɔn dwumadie no ho hia Yudafoɔ nyinaa yie. <verse eid="NEH 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45"/>Wɔyɛɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn som no ne ahodwira som no pɛpɛɛpɛ, sɛdeɛ Dawid ne ne babarima Salomo mmara kyerɛ no, na saa ara nso na nnwomtofoɔ no ne aponoanohwɛfoɔ no yɛeɛ. <verse eid="NEH 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46"/>Amammerɛ a wɔma nnwomtofoɔ akwankyerɛfoɔ di nnwomtofoɔ no anim wɔ nkamfo ne aseda nnwom a wɔto de ma Onyankopɔn no hyɛɛ aseɛ firii Dawid ne Asaf berɛ so. <verse eid="NEH 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47"/>Enti, ɛfiri Serubabel ne Nehemia berɛ so no, na daa ɔmanfoɔ brɛ nnwomtofoɔ no ne aponoanohwɛfoɔ ne Lewifoɔ no nnuane. Na Lewifoɔ no nso de deɛ wɔnya no mu bi ma asɔfoɔ a wɔyɛ Aaron asefoɔ no.<verse eid="NEH 12:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Nehemia Nsiesie Nnwuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1"/>Ɛda no ara, ɛberɛ a wɔgu so rekenkan Mose Nwoma no, ɔmanfoɔ no hunuu asɛm bi a ɛka sɛ, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔma Amonni anaa Moabni kwan ma ɔkɔ Onyankopɔn adwabɔ ase. <verse eid="NEH 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2"/>Aseɛ ne sɛ, ɛberɛ a Israelfoɔ firii Misraim no, wɔne wɔn anni no yie. Mmom, wɔbɔɔ Balaam paa sɛ ɔnnome wɔn, nanso yɛn Onyankopɔn danee nnome no ma ɛyɛɛ nhyira. <verse eid="NEH 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3"/>Wɔkenkan saa mmara no wiee no, wɔpamoo amanfrafoɔ no nyinaa firii badwa no ase.<verse eid="NEH 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4"/>Ansa na saa asɛm yi rebɛsi no, na ɔsɔfoɔ Eliasib a wɔyii no sɛ ɔnyɛ Onyankopɔn Asɔredan no adekoradan sohwɛfoɔ no a na ɔsane yɛ Tobia busuani no, <verse eid="NEH 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5"/>adane adekoradan kɛseɛ no bi mu de ahyɛ Tobia nsa. Na anka saa dan no mu na wɔkora atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ, aduhwamfufuo, Asɔredan no nkuku ne nkaka ne atokoɔ ntotosoɔ dudu, nsã foforɔ, ngo ne kyɛfa sononko a wɔahyɛ sɛ wɔmfa mma asɔfoɔ. Na Mose ahyɛ sɛ saa afɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ Lewifoɔ, nnwomtofoɔ ne aponoanohwɛfoɔ dea.<verse eid="NEH 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na menni Yerusalem. Na masane kɔ Babiloniahene Artasasta nkyɛn wɔ nʼahennie afe a ɛtɔ so aduasa mmienu so. Akyire no na ɔmaa me kwan sɛ mensane mmra. <verse eid="NEH 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7"/>Mebɛduruu Yerusalem, na metee bɔne a Eliasib ayɛ, sɛ ɔde Onyankopɔn Asɔredan adihɔ dan bi ama Tobia no, <verse eid="NEH 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8"/>ɛtɔɔ me so, na meyii Tobia nneɛma a ɛwɔ dan no mu no nyinaa guiɛ. <verse eid="NEH 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9"/>Afei mehyɛɛ sɛ, wɔnnwira adan no nyinaa ho, na mede Awurade Asɔredan no nkuku ne nkaka no, atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ ne aduhwamfufuo no sane bɛguu mu.<verse eid="NEH 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10"/>Mesane hunuu sɛ wɔmfaa deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ Lewifoɔ no nya no mmaa wɔn, enti, na wɔne nnwomtofoɔ no a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔhwɛ ɔsom no so no asane akɔyɛ adwuma wɔ wɔn mfuo mu. <verse eid="NEH 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11"/>Ɛhɔ ara na mekɔɔ ntuanofoɔ no nkyɛn, kɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, “Adɛn enti na moayi mo ani afiri Onyankopɔn Asɔredan no so?” Na mefrɛɛ Lewifoɔ no nyinaa, maa wɔsane baeɛ, de wɔn tuatuaa nnwuma a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyɛ ano.<verse eid="NEH 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12"/>Na bio, Yudafoɔ nyinaa hyɛɛ aseɛ de wɔn atokoɔ ntotosoɔ dudu, nsã foforɔ ne ngo baa Asɔredan no adekoradan no mu. <verse eid="NEH 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13"/>Na mede adekoradan no hyɛɛ ɔsɔfoɔ Selemia, mmara no ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ Sadok ne Lewifoɔ no mu baako a wɔfrɛ no Pedaia nsa sɛ wɔnhwɛ so. Na meyii Sakur babarima Hanan a ɔyɛ Matania nana sɛ wɔn ɔboafoɔ. Na saa mmarima yi wɔ edin pa, na wɔn adwuma ne sɛ, wɔde nokorɛ bɛkyɛ nneɛma ama wɔn mfɛfoɔ Lewifoɔ no.<verse eid="NEH 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14"/>Kae saa ade pa yi yɛ, Ao me Onyankopɔn, na mma wo werɛ mfiri deɛ mefiri nokorɛdie mu ayɛ nyinaa de ama me Onyankopɔn Asɔredan.<verse eid="NEH 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15"/>Ɛda koro Homeda bi, mehunuu Yuda mmarima bi sɛ wɔretiatia wɔn nsakyiamena so. Na wɔrehyehyɛ atokoɔ afiafi wɔ wɔn mfunumu so de aba. Na saa da no, na wɔde wɔn nsã, bobe aba, borɔdɔma ne mfudeɛ bebree reba Yerusalem abɛtɔn. Na mekaa wɔn anim sɛ, wɔretɔn wɔn mfudeɛ homeda. <verse eid="NEH 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16"/>Na mmarima bi nso firi Tiro a wɔde nsuomnam ne adwadeɛ ahodoɔ bebree aba. Na wɔretɔn no Homeda ama Yudafoɔ wɔ Yerusalem fie ankasa! <verse eid="NEH 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17"/>Ɛno enti, mekɔɔ Yuda ntuanofoɔ no so, kɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, “Adɛn enti na mode saa bɔne yi gu homeda ho fi? <verse eid="NEH 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18"/>Monnim sɛ mo agyanom yɛɛ saa bi no enti na yɛn Onyankopɔn de saa ɔhaw a ɛwɔ yɛn so seesei yi brɛɛ yɛn ne yɛn kuro yi? Gu a moregu Homeda no ho fi ntrasoɔ seesei no bɛma abufuhyeɛ aba Israelfoɔ so.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19"/>Na afei, mehyɛɛ sɛ, ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no rekorɔ, Efiada biara anwummerɛ, wɔntoto kuro no apono mu a wɔmmue ara kɔsi sɛ Homeda no bɛtwam. Bio, memaa mʼankasa mʼasomfoɔ kɔwɛnn apono no, sɛdeɛ wɔrentumi mfa adwadeɛ mma homeda no. <verse eid="NEH 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20"/>Adwadifoɔ ne nsaanodwumayɛfoɔ a wɔde adwadeɛ ahodoɔ ba no soɛɛ Yerusalem mfikyire pɛnkorɔ anaa mprenu. <verse eid="NEH 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21"/>Nanso, mekasa kyerɛɛ wɔn anibereɛ so sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na motete ɔfasuo yi akyi reyɛ? Sɛ moyɛ saa bio a, mɛkyere mo!” Ɛfiri hɔ, wɔamma Yerusalem wɔ Homeda bio. <verse eid="NEH 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22"/>Na mehyɛɛ Lewifoɔ no sɛ, wɔnnwira wɔn ho, na wɔnnwɛn apono no sɛdeɛ Homeda no kronnyɛ no bɛka hɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:22"/>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Kae saa ade pa yi yɛ nso, Ao me Onyankopɔn, na wʼadɔeɛ kɛseɛ a ɛnsa da no enti, hunu me mmɔbɔ.<verse eid="NEH 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23"/>Saa ɛberɛ korɔ no ara mu, mehunuu sɛ Yuda mmarima no bi awareware mmaa a wɔfiri Asdod, Amon ne Moab. <verse eid="NEH 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24"/>Na deɛ na ɛnyɛ koraa ne sɛ, na wɔn mma no mu fa ka Asdod ne nnipa foforɔ bi kasa a na wɔntumi nka Yudafoɔ kasa no koraa. <verse eid="NEH 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25"/>Enti, mekɔɔ wɔn so, kɔdomee wɔn. Mehwee wɔn mu bi, tutuu wɔn tirinwi. Memaa wɔkaa ntam Awurade anim sɛ, wɔremma wɔn mma ne abosonsomfoɔ a wɔwɔ asase no so nni awadeɛ. <verse eid="NEH 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26"/>Mebisaa sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ yei bi pɛpɛɛpɛ na ɛde Israelhene Salomo kɔɔ bɔne mu no?” Na wode ɔman biara so ɔhene to ne ho a, ɛnyɛ yie. Onyankopɔn dɔɔ no, na ɔsii no ɔhene wɔ Israel nyinaa so. Nanso, ɔno mpo ananafoɔ awadeɛ de no kɔɔ bɔne mu. <verse eid="NEH 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27"/>Ɛdeɛn na ɛha mo ma modwene sɛ mobɛware ananafoɔ mmaa, na monam so ayɛ bɔne a ɛte saa, na monni Onyankopɔn nokorɛ?<verse eid="NEH 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28"/>Esiane sɛ ɔsɔfopanin Eliasib babarima Yehoiada aware Horonni Sanbalat babaa enti, mepamoo no firii mʼanim.<verse eid="NEH 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29"/>Kae wɔn, Ao me Onyankopɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔagu asɔfodwuma, asɔfoɔ ne Lewifoɔ bɔhyɛ ne ntam ho fi.<verse eid="NEH 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30"/>Enti, meguu biribiara a ɛyɛ ananasɛm, na mede nnwuma hyehyɛɛ asɔfoɔ ne Lewifoɔ nsa, hwɛɛ sɛ obiara nim nʼadwuma. <verse eid="NEH 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31"/>Mehwɛɛ nso sɛ, nnyina a ɛba afɔrebukyia so no nso bɛba mmerɛ a ɛsɛ mu, na afei wɔbɛgye otwa a ɛdi ɛkan no mu nnɔbaeɛ de abrɛ asɔfoɔ no.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:31"/>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Kae yei na dom me, Ao me Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="NEH 13:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13"/>
</usx>
